1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:00,620
Good morning.

2
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:06,360
I would like to welcome all of the 8 trainee chefs from the Food Science and Technology College this morning.

3
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:08,620
We hope your stay here will be profitable.

4
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:14,300
I should also mention that our chain of restaurants regularly employs young graduates from your college.

5
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:20,820
So, we'll be watching you, and if any of you are interested in future employment with us, please let us know.

6
00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:26,175
You may not be aware that our chain has restaurants in all the major cities of England and Europe.

7
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:32,040
We have also recently opened restaurants in India, Southeast Asia, China, and Japan.

8
00:00:32,440 --> 00:00:37,300
We encourage overseas work experience as a way of developing exciting cooking styles.

9
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:42,260
So working with us can be a fabulous experience if you have the right attitude.

10
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:44,000
So, let's get busy.

11
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:48,400
Please check the notice board to find out which team you have been assigned to.
